.Dd May 18, 2026
.Dt MACOSWHEELS-RANGE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm macoswheels-range
.Nd set rotation range of a racing wheel
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm macoswheels
.Cm range
.Ar degrees
.Op Ar wheel
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Sets the physical lock-to-lock rotation range of the selected wheel,
in degrees.
.Pp
The accepted range depends on the wheel.
The Thrustmaster T150 accepts 270..1080 degrees.
The Logitech G29 accepts 40..900 degrees.
Out-of-bounds values are rejected with exit status 2.
.Pp
The new value is also written to the user preferences plist and
reapplied at login.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr macoswheels 1
